WEBVTT

00:11:26.014 --> 00:11:31.562
When we shift the power of philanthropy
into all of our voices,

00:11:31.562 --> 00:11:34.148
we change who gives,

00:11:34.189 --> 00:11:35.733
how we give,

00:11:35.733 --> 00:11:38.193
and ultimately, what gets funded.

00:11:39.987 --> 00:11:44.283
Giving by, for and with
the communities we represent

00:11:44.324 --> 00:11:46.118
is the future of philanthropy.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:49.455
And each and every one of us

00:11:49.496 --> 00:11:51.165
belong in this movement.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:56.003
(Applause)

00:11:56.044 --> 00:11:58.172
Just think.

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:02.384
What if every town, every issue,